{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_17\">Problem 17</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 17\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/e/78eb32a52b6716abe7e8df0c92b9c4691fc0e2af.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); dotfactor=3; pair A=(0,0),B=(1,0),C=(2,0),D=(3,0),X=(1.2,0.7); draw(A--D); dot(A);dot(B);dot(C);dot(D); draw(arc((0.4,0.4),0.4,180,110),arrow = Arrow(TeXHead)); draw(arc((2.6,0.4),0.4,0,70),arrow = Arrow(TeXHead)); draw(B--X,dotted); draw(C--X,dotted); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,S); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,S); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S); label(&quot;x&quot;,X,fontsize(5pt)); //Credit to TheMaskedMagician for the diagram [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"105\" />\n</p><p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/1/fa17ca5d40b6df4b945351bb8b7f973b93000aa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A , B, C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are distinct and lie, in the given order, on a straight line. \nLine segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/547f225d9af24dda08195ad51ee009872c3d3fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB, AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"64\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> have lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, respectively. \nIf line segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> may be rotated about points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, respectively, \nso that points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> coincide, to form a triangle with positive area, \nthen which of the following three inequalities must be satisfied?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce35773055bb7151a6b6b202abe69ca3ee2ddf6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{I. }x&lt;\\frac{z}{2}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{II. }y&lt;x+\\frac{z}{2}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{III. }y&lt;\\frac{z}{2}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"101\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98c60c1f280e6788651c2310d954a5662c8bfe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\textbf{I. }\\text{only}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\textbf{II. }\\text{only}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\textbf{I. }\\text{and }\\textbf{II. }\\text{only}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\textbf{II. }\\text{and }\\textbf{III. }\\text{only}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\textbf{I. },\\textbf{II. },\\text{and }\\textbf{III. }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"769\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p>We know that this triangle has lengths of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/2/1528b38e29e999e114af339c40ba2596e89c8182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/1/3f1d516db531c1a66f4f54fec76743404a5c06b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"11\" />. Using the Triangle Inequality, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inequalities: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b462eebf307e1c547c7b879e5a98f8652edaf2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y&gt;z, z&gt;2x, 2x+z&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"205\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e9c009d622ad76a8f8dd51d14efb342bdf00c43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{I}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\" /> is true and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a67b566416e3dee397c1f10d1bd2c7e2690f1ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{III}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> is false. In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b7d9ea23c927b5f89556a78ccb5b2dc0c1e0a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{II}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />, we have to prove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a206abae8a79b2dc08e7d8482703372f0fc5e97a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y&lt;2x+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />. We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/0/c2058880a63e8c46feef3f82eb1ad8f5c8d2577c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y&gt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, so we have to prove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d511edaacfb1e08878f4000b8554c27445a9f0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&lt;2y&lt;2x+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/624f4a31ff6195d5aa4e38423a948a3b881aaaa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, so we have to prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/621563839b33cc07040a4b2ca0c7e80c1977e2f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&lt;2z$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, which is true for all positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/b/86bd69e5cb8dc0de780b00853cf6e88e926a5255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } \\textbf{I. }\\text{and }\\textbf{II. }\\text{only}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"155\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016220012\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 218/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6169/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.758      1 -total\n 57.89%    7.386      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 40.29%    5.140      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15270:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016220012 and revision id 82217. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}